Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 19:25:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 08/13] UI: wire the Pimax pages into the sidebar shell

Headset / Eye Tracking / Controllers pages fill the shell's slots, the summary
tiles replace the old Pimax card on Home; removes pimax_box.rs and messages
that are no longer used. Builds without warnings.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
